[{"id":5,"slug":"home","content":{"rendered":"<section class=\"aloha-home-hero wp-block-aloha-home-hero\" data-logo-style=\"round\">\n    <div class=\"aloha-home-hero__content aloha-home-hero__content--round\">\n        <img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1670\" height=\"1670\" src=\"/aloha-alpha/media/d49de22bf68f20ec0a98.png\" class=\"aloha-home-hero__round-logo\" alt=\"Aloha Academy\" loading=\"eager\">        <h3 class=\"aloha-home-hero__slogan aloha-heading--latin\">Aloha starts here</h3>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"aloha-home-hero__slides\"><figure class=\"aloha-home-hero__slide\" data-slide-index=\"0\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aloha-home-hero__image\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/aloha-alpha/media/62f1ba8f668604bb4ce1.avif\" width=\"2092\" height=\"1174\"></figure><figure class=\"aloha-home-hero__slide\" data-slide-index=\"1\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aloha-home-hero__image\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/aloha-alpha/media/fa97bd11eb2de9e89d4a.avif\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1606\"></figure><figure class=\"aloha-home-hero__slide\" data-slide-index=\"2\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aloha-home-hero__image\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/aloha-alpha/media/9788f32a7e58b72d13b8.avif\" width=\"2318\" height=\"1290\"></figure><figure class=\"aloha-home-hero__slide\" data-slide-index=\"3\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aloha-home-hero__image\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/aloha-alpha/media/2edb88d59392a9ae823d.jpg\" width=\"1038\" height=\"685\"></figure><figure class=\"aloha-home-hero__slide\" data-slide-index=\"4\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aloha-home-hero__image\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/aloha-alpha/media/ce1517d0995f3d6290ac.jpg\" width=\"1477\" height=\"1108\"></figure><figure class=\"aloha-home-hero__slide\" data-slide-index=\"5\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aloha-home-hero__image\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/aloha-alpha/media/270f8f02a970541d289c.jpg\" width=\"1170\" height=\"657\"></figure></div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"wp-block-aloha-text-image-side-by-side aloha-text-image aloha-text-image--image-left aloha-text-image--cream theme-cream\" data-bottom-wave=\"false\" data-color-scheme=\"cream\" data-image-width=\"40\" data-layout=\"image-left\" data-top-wave=\"false\"><h2 class=\"aloha-text-image__title aloha-heading--japanese\"><strong>Aloha Academyが大切にしていること</strong></h2><div class=\"aloha-text-image__columns\" style=\"--aloha-side-image-column:40fr;--aloha-side-text-column:60fr\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-aloha-text-image-media aloha-text-image__media\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-aloha-image-frame aloha-image-frame aloha-image-frame--round\" data-frame-type=\"round\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" class=\"aloha-image-frame__image\" height=\"2560\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 767px) 100vw, 40vw\" src=\"/aloha-alpha/media/af2be32c27c301cd2616.avif\" srcset=\"/aloha-alpha/media/4f6c67343ee9da94ff9b.avif 150w, /aloha-alpha/media/e6e871541c536d2c600d.avif 225w, /aloha-alpha/media/66389f0271bf5db9e59d.avif 768w, /aloha-alpha/media/af2be32c27c301cd2616.avif 1920w\" width=\"1920\"></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-aloha-text-image-content aloha-text-image__content\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">地域の子どもたちが、幼い頃から英語を身近に感じ、英語に抵抗なく触れられる環境をつくることを大切にしています。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">幼い頃からネイティブの自然な英語をたくさん聞くことで、英語の音・リズム・イントネーションを身につけ、まずは「英語を聞くことが楽しい」「英語って特別なものではない」と感じてもらうことを大切にしています。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">英語を単なる「勉強」として身につけるのではなく、人とコミュニケーションをするための言葉として自然に使えるようになることを目指します。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>英語で自分を表現できる自信</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">これがAloha Academyが子どもたちに提供したい大きな価値の一つです。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">英語を学ぶ中で、聞く → 理解する → 考える → 自分の言葉で伝えるという経験を積み重ねることで、少しずつ「英語で伝えられる」という自信を育てていきます。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">そしていつか子どもたちが英語を使って、自分の考えや気持ちを世界中の人に伝えられる人になってほしいと考えています。</p>\n</div>\n</div></section>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-aloha-image-divider aloha-image-divider\" data-divider-height=\"60\" style=\"height:60vh\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" class=\"aloha-image-divider__image\" height=\"1707\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" src=\"/aloha-alpha/media/e332f2b07d4c084970ee.jpg\" srcset=\"/aloha-alpha/media/82c7e8ad8eb050a37f2e.jpg 150w, /aloha-alpha/media/4f84651aa2b4b65aaefe.jpg 300w, /aloha-alpha/media/cfdcb06040391155ec57.jpg 1024w, /aloha-alpha/media/e332f2b07d4c084970ee.jpg 2560w\" width=\"2560\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"wp-block-aloha-page-links aloha-page-links\" data-page-links-version=\"1\"><ul class=\"aloha-page-links__list\"><li class=\"aloha-page-links__item\" data-page-link-id=\"fd92cd0e-f433-45dd-8ee2-511cfa83a76e\"><a class=\"aloha-page-links__link\" data-page-link-id=\"fd92cd0e-f433-45dd-8ee2-511cfa83a76e\" href=\"/aloha-alpha/classes/\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"aloha-page-links__icon\" data-icon=\"person-chalkboard\"></span><span class=\"aloha-page-links__label\">クラス</span></a></li><li class=\"aloha-page-links__item\" data-page-link-id=\"620a0c55-c4da-4948-bd97-105c5f65a91f\"><a class=\"aloha-page-links__link\" data-page-link-id=\"620a0c55-c4da-4948-bd97-105c5f65a91f\" href=\"/aloha-alpha/gallery/\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"aloha-page-links__icon\" data-icon=\"camera\"></span><span class=\"aloha-page-links__label\">ギャラリー</span></a></li><li class=\"aloha-page-links__item\" data-page-link-id=\"9feed49c-c800-4838-836e-ff07ab1104bd\"><a class=\"aloha-page-links__link\" data-page-link-id=\"9feed49c-c800-4838-836e-ff07ab1104bd\" href=\"/aloha-alpha/booking/\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"aloha-page-links__icon\" data-icon=\"calendar-days\"></span><span class=\"aloha-page-links__label\">ご予約</span></a></li><li class=\"aloha-page-links__item\" data-page-link-id=\"807314a1-9f85-4f1f-ae53-b4036fe5e659\"><a class=\"aloha-page-links__link\" data-page-link-id=\"807314a1-9f85-4f1f-ae53-b4036fe5e659\" href=\"/aloha-alpha/faqs/\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"aloha-page-links__icon\" data-icon=\"question\"></span><span class=\"aloha-page-links__label\">FAQs</span></a></li></ul></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"wp-block-aloha-testimonials aloha-testimonials\" data-testimonials-version=\"1\"><div class=\"aloha-testimonials__background\"><img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" class=\"aloha-testimonials__background-image\" height=\"1553\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" src=\"/aloha-alpha/media/08f24ccf10658f59ca01.jpg\" srcset=\"/aloha-alpha/media/6c4ce440b5aead5154d1.jpg 150w, /aloha-alpha/media/27be4c7350ee7e9d84cf.jpg 300w, /aloha-alpha/media/1b6875f927dbe31ad5be.jpg 1024w, /aloha-alpha/media/08f24ccf10658f59ca01.jpg 2560w\" width=\"2560\"></div><div class=\"aloha-testimonials__track\"><article class=\"aloha-testimonials__card\" data-testimonial-id=\"a373cb8c-ac53-4355-9c8a-03590fc80ded\"><blockquote class=\"aloha-testimonials__quote\"><p>私はアロハ・アカデミーが大好きです。</p></blockquote><p class=\"aloha-testimonials__name\">ほのか</p></article><article class=\"aloha-testimonials__card\" data-testimonial-id=\"62385a8b-815f-4ada-b1cc-5f87fa02b350\"><blockquote class=\"aloha-testimonials__quote\"><p>アロハアカデミーは最高です</p></blockquote><p class=\"aloha-testimonials__name\">拓真</p></article><article class=\"aloha-testimonials__card\" data-testimonial-id=\"ff97b159-b372-422d-adc3-9aa7b4da5f44\"><blockquote class=\"aloha-testimonials__quote\"><p>うちの子たちは、毎週アロハ・アカデミーに通うのが大好きです。</p></blockquote><p class=\"aloha-testimonials__name\">瞳</p></article><article class=\"aloha-testimonials__card\" data-testimonial-id=\"c2ada869-fed4-4031-a96a-a6d5704fdcda\"><blockquote class=\"aloha-testimonials__quote\"><p>うちの子は、とても短期間で英語をたくさん習得しました。</p></blockquote><p class=\"aloha-testimonials__name\">海斗</p></article></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"wp-block-aloha-access-map aloha-access-map\" data-access-map-version=\"1\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3236.9855011863556!2d139.3004726!3d35.7757325!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i76